1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,280
I am delighted to be here, and I'm particularly delighted to be here on this occasion.

2
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:11,660
We meet at a college noted for knowledge, in a city noted for progress,

3
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:16,780
in a state noted for strength, and we stand in need of all three.

4
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:27,360
For we meet in an hour of change and challenge, in a decade of hope and fear, in an age of both knowledge and ignorance.

5
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:33,050
The greater our knowledge increases, the greater our ignorance unfolds.

6
00:00:33,770 --> 00:00:42,160
Despite the striking fact that most of the scientists that the world has ever known are alive and working today,

7
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:49,940
despite the fact that this nation's own scientific manpower is doubling every 12 years

8
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:56,100
in a rate of growth more than three times that of our population as

9
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:56,400
a whole,

10
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:58,040
despite that,

